From de88a0df68f80373b7a0efc048b1380894a6b215 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Benjamin Hempel <b.hempel@confined-space.de>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 19:56:01 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] vulkan: AllReduce for -sm tensor from PR #25051, Vulkan part
 only, rebased on df03399b8

Taken from pwilkin/llama.cpp@vulkan-tp-p2p (13ac90156) without the multi-buffer
crash workaround in ggml-backend*.  Measurement branch.
---
 ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/ggml-vulkan.cpp | 909 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
